#question(title: [Composition and inverses])[
  Assume for simplicity that all functions in
  this problem have domain $RR$.

  #v(1fr)

  Let $f$ and $g$ be functions. Assume they
  each have an inverse.

  #v(1fr)

  Is
  $display((f circle.small g)^(-1) = f^(-1) circle.small g^(-1))$?

  - If YES, prove it.
  - If NO, fix the statement.

  #v(1fr)

  If you do not know how to start, experiment
  with the functions
  $
    f(x) = x + 1, quad quad g(x) = 2 x .
  $
]
